omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6pvwKF7UM-kQ7kNvwEpO3hq&_nc_oc=Adp8i3TH8I7oYcfHtoG9yOjIhvH-sbpbBilwoYQ3ear-qKnr62yjFEx4M4oqOwnfgEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB7hAl-BG7ivutP0a3wAjfnjQlkgRAHrh8czFD43eWd_A&oe=6A6DD6F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V9WCi9DhrGIQ7kNvwGjU2hi&_nc_oc=AdozLWdbtJ69HxH9gxV0wHDah6pFo7NI2B1bAuqEmXyOo0pX3fI7oePMiggZ5Dd4sFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBP4OpokAMe4I9b5QrQ2jZzkdw1QorVGALiNaRqunl4AA&oe=6A6DD856"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cUMSI8eT_NAQ7kNvwHuUYTL&_nc_oc=Adp3yW3Uf0zhMo_X3HDRqdlbc4ufUg96Yz3RlZD8RT-kameyqYJm8yPIdNaggXNAaak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCSG9C_qBWqbgVYo1c43nCAdyi8zfbn8uJFcSxpbvZu6g&oe=6A6DED77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://